1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:03,595
In 1913, crowds lined up in Chicago to see

2
00:00:03,605 --> 00:00:04,528
a devil baby.

3
00:00:05,178 --> 00:00:07,507
The rumor said a baby with hooves and a

4
00:00:07,517 --> 00:00:09,528
tail was hidden at Hull-House, Jane

5
00:00:09,538 --> 00:00:11,681
Addams's settlement house on Halsted

6
00:00:11,691 --> 00:00:12,011
Street.

7
00:00:12,461 --> 00:00:14,550
For six weeks, people streamed in from all

8
